## S2 — Transmission Card Header: Pulsing Logo

The small pulsating dot currently sitting next to `"INCOMING TRANSMISSION"` in the card header should be **replaced with a miniature Canada ICI logo** that pulses with a glow effect.

### Visual Treatment

- The logo replaces the dot indicator at the same position and approximate scale — small enough to sit comfortably next to the header text without competing with it.
- The logo itself remains **fully visible at all times**. It does not fade in and out.
- A soft light **blooms outward** from the logo rhythmically — a glow pulse — consistent in timing with the existing dot pulse behaviour.

### Glow Color

Reads from the `role` value in the Zustand store:

| Role | Glow Color |
|---|---|
| Mission Control | `amg-blue` #009DD6 |
| Commander | `ici-red` #D80010 |

### Implementation Notes

The glow pulse can be achieved using a `box-shadow` or `filter: drop-shadow()` animation cycling between low and high intensity values. Use Framer Motion `animate` with `repeat: Infinity`. **Animate only the glow outward from the logo — do not animate the opacity of the logo itself.**

```tsx
<motion.div
  animate={{
    filter: [
      "drop-shadow(0 0 2px #009DD6)",
      "drop-shadow(0 0 10px #009DD6)",
      "drop-shadow(0 0 2px #009DD6)",
    ],
  }}
  transition={{ duration: 1.8, repeat: Infinity, ease: "easeInOut" }}
>
  <Image src="/assets/logo.svg" ... />
</motion.div>
```

